<title>USA: First Union says approves two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>First Union says approves two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Corp said Tuesday its board approved a two-for-one split of the company's common shares, to be effected in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock split is payable July 31 to shareholders of record July 1, First Union said.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
